  "question": {
    "text": "The value of the&nbsp; determinant <math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>26</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>65</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
