  "solution": {
    "text": "Taking  <math><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math>  common from  <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and  <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> , we get<br/><br/> <math><mo>∆</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>26</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>65</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math> <br/><br/>Applying  <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo></math>  we get<br/><br/> <math><mo>∆</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>18</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>"
